     "label": "mcp-js-prototype-pollution-merge-loop (medium/medium)",
     "detail": "Keys from a caller-supplied object are copied onto a target without excluding __proto__ / constructor / prototype. A tool argument carrying __proto__ then mutates Object.prototype for the whole process, which can turn an unrelated later property read into attacker-controlled data.",
     "path": "mcpb/server/index.mjs",
     "line": 41,
     "excerpt": "  const capabilities = {};\n  for (const name of ['tools', 'resources', 'prompts']) {\n    if (available[name]) capabilities[name] = {};\n  }\n  server = new Server(",
     "url": "",
